  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Power 18 is the thinnest and most power-oriented version of the NXT Power family. Formerly known as NXT Tour, it uses high-crystallinity Xycro microfibers bonded with polyurethane to provide an exceptionally soft, comfortable and explosive response. A ribbon-like co-polymer core improves tensile strength and helps reduce tension loss. Wilson reports a 15% larger sweet spot and 80% less vibration than traditional synthetic gut, while the USRSA has rated NXT Power as a #1 comfort string. At 1.21 mm / 18 gauge, this version prioritizes maximum power, feel and pocketing over durability.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Power 18 是 NXT Power 系列中最细、同时也是最强调力量的版本，原名 NXT Tour。它采用高结晶度 Xycro 微纤维并通过 Polyurethane 聚氨酯结合，带来非常柔软、舒适并具有爆发力的击球反馈。Ribbon-Like Co-Polymer Core 用于提升抗拉强度并减少击球过程中的张力流失。Wilson 表示它相比传统 Synthetic Gut 拥有约 15% 更大的 Sweet Spot，并减少约 80% 的震动；USRSA 还曾将其评为 #1 Comfort String。1.21 毫米 / 18 规格特别强调 Power、Feel 和 Pocketing，但耐久性会低于更粗规格。"
  },

